/34 VERSN3    			AVL	PHIL SIEMENS
/	29-SEP-78 --- OS8 V3D UPDATE

/ VERSN3 PROVIDES AN EXPANDED CAPABILITY OF  THE .VER
/ COMMAND. THE GENERAL STRUCTURE IS:
/
/	.VER [ODEV:[FILE.XX]][<][IDEV:][OPTS]
/
/ .VER IS THE DEFAULT COMMAND AND PRINTS THE VERSION #
/ OF OS/8 AND CCL AS USUAL.
/ THE /E OPTION CAUSES AN EXPANDED PRINTOUT TO
/ OCCUR.  THE VERSION NUMBERS OF ALL CUSPS THAT
/ VERSN3 KNOWS ABOUT ARE PRINTED ALSO.
/ IF THE FILE VERNUM.SV IS PRESENT ON SYS, IT WILL
/ BE USED TO SPECIFY ADDITIONAL CUSPS.  SEE LATER
/ COMMENTS FOR TABLE FORMAT.  ORIGIN THE TABLE AT
/ 00000, LOAD AND SAVE IT.  THE LENGTH MUST BE LESS
/ THAN 1600 OCTAL.

/ NOTE THAT CCL MUST BE REASSEMBLED TO CHAIN
/ TO VERSN3 IN ORDER FOR THESE COMMANDS TO WORK.
